### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Register a new user invalid data

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juanexample.com",
  "password": "a"
}

### Register a new user try role ADMIN
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@admin.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Login with register user
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@admin.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login with register user but incorrect password
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@admin.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login with wrong user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@error.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Get my data (with token)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get my data (without token)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me